<!doctype lake><title>🦫 𝓡𝓮𝓯𝓲𝓷𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="nDKqj" id="nDKqj" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua86ac825" id="ua86ac825">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="ued291191" id="ued291191"> 𝐃𝐀𝐏𝐎: 𝐀𝐧 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐧-𝐒𝐨𝐮𝐫𝐜𝐞 𝐋𝐋𝐌 𝐑𝐞𝐢𝐧𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐜𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐋𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐲𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐦 𝐚𝐭 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐞</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue8add5e7" id="ue8add5e7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79715e86" id="u79715e86">以 OpenAI 的 o1 和 DeepSeek 的 R1 为代表的测试时扩展（test-time scaling），正在推动大语言模型的深刻范式变革。测试时扩展支持更长的思维链推理，并激发复杂的推理行为，使模型在 AIME 和 Codeforces 等数学竞赛与编程任务中表现出更强的能力。推动这一变革的核心技术是大规模强化学习，它能够激发自我验证和迭代改进等复杂推理行为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc240a574" id="uc240a574"><strong><span data-lake-id="u262f463e" id="u262f463e">朴素的 GRPO 基线存在熵坍塌、奖励噪声和训练不稳定等若干关键问题。作者提出解耦裁剪与动态采样策略优化算法，并引入四项关键技术，以提升强化学习在长思维链场景中的表现</span></strong></p><ul list="u21a2dc84"><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u15611010" id="u15611010"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3559ae7" id="ua3559ae7" style="color: #E4495B">提高裁剪上界（Clip-Higher）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u48d1eebb" id="u48d1eebb" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="u36c2a19d" id="u36c2a19d">提升系统的生成多样性，避免熵坍塌</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u7b33159e" id="u7b33159e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ude0e3a98" id="ude0e3a98" style="color: #E4495B">动态采样（Dynamic Sampling）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uef14dd68" id="uef14dd68" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="u431b9060" id="u431b9060">提高训练效率和稳定性</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="u34b129bc" id="u34b129bc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3cb4491f" id="u3cb4491f" style="color: #E4495B">Token 级策略梯度损失（Token-Level Policy Gradient Loss）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u21272fae" id="u21272fae" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="ua709b17c" id="ua709b17c">在长思维链强化学习场景中发挥关键作用</span></li><li fid="u79284554" data-lake-id="uf8da9926" id="uf8da9926"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3bb9435" id="ua3bb9435" style="color: #E4495B">超长回答奖励塑形（Overlong Reward Shaping）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua481e377" id="ua481e377" style="color: #E4495B">：</span><span data-lake-id="ub3b68746" id="ub3b68746">减少奖励噪声，稳定训练过程</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="G5bN1" id="G5bN1" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u683d0e8e" id="u683d0e8e">🌈</span><span data-lake-id="u08cdc010" id="u08cdc010"> 𝐏𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫𝐲</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u38c4f13a" id="u38c4f13a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd000754" id="ufd000754">PPO 引入用于策略优化的裁剪代理目标。通过裁剪操作将策略更新限制在旧策略的邻近区域内，PPO 能够稳定训练过程并提高样本效率。PPO 通过最大化以下目标来更新策略</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue5a233c2" id="ue5a233c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BPPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2Co_%7B%5C%5Cleq%20t%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_t%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7B%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1ba3c9a72579ca7e29aec3b71fc4bf61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K6OXI%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3d511360"><li fid="ub0afcbd6" data-lake-id="u12de651d" id="u12de651d"><span data-lake-id="u3c003d89" id="u3c003d89">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(q%2Ca)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcded0170475baa79807951d7672a19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GnnAs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua71942bd" id="ua71942bd">是来自数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5903f53f4f8c62f99df77e4e3ccbc4e3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JgHXZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6a69b58" id="ue6a69b58">的问答对，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc57c5f0e31d8960d9406bb149fced9e0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OmNxG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6851c97c" id="u6851c97c">为重要性采样比率的裁剪范围，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff83bb5178226fd8754417abdd0f5005.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SGPTy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u389c4ce7" id="u389c4ce7">为时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dzxis%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3549e06b" id="u3549e06b">处的优势估计值。给定价值函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9f493997c33913987175caf4a4849955.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yHpmv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub497d088" id="ub497d088">和奖励函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd1caa3f2e1582dab2cf9bfdb21b7556.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c59WL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29a08cf8" id="u29a08cf8">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fff83bb5178226fd8754417abdd0f5005.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lNpbd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7fc256d" id="ua7fc256d"> 通过广义优势估计计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua5e872fe" id="ua5e872fe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGAE%7D(%5C%5Cgamma%2C%5C%5Clambda)%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bl%3D0%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cinfty%7D(%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Clambda)%5El%5C%5Cdelta_%7Bt%2Bl%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2f98853d17398412faf4f998acd0a726.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gi1SU%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue683767d" id="ue683767d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_l%3DR_l%2B%5C%5Cgamma%20V(s_%7Bl%2B1%7D)-V(s_l)%2C%5C%5Cquad%200%5C%5Cleq%5C%5Cgamma%2C%5C%5Clambda%5C%5Cleq%201.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4875f396c66ffff0181732557425bbf3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XjJ0p%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ufb0cc2d6" id="ufb0cc2d6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f11a7cb" id="u7f11a7cb" style="color: #101E60">GRPO 不再需要价值函数，而是以组内相对方式估计优势。对于给定的问答对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(q%2Ca)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbcded0170475baa79807951d7672a19d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TdanE%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u775bd07b" id="u775bd07b" style="color: #101E60">，行为策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619756aa1fc9995330d2f111c852dc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nUBM1%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5c5714b" id="ua5c5714b" style="color: #101E60">采样生成一组包含</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8df64a4bfdeb9bdcbc357668b6fb123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rhh5T%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u38db3ac3" id="u38db3ac3" style="color: #101E60">个回答的集合</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JemYn%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5201214" id="ud5201214" style="color: #101E60">。随后，通过对组内奖励</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff5ec0ee5c2b3113c37e459a53a477496.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DyOuA%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u520a9ef6" id="u520a9ef6" style="color: #101E60">进行标准化，计算第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22k1sQA%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de4e16d" id="u5de4e16d" style="color: #101E60">个回答的优势</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5e7f6050" id="u5e7f6050" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Br_i-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffaabdec6942d4e0b7b5cc79a82bd349b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kq6a2%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub433533b"><li fid="uec4cd6ae" data-lake-id="u092dcd51" id="u092dcd51"><span data-lake-id="u3f00c81b" id="u3f00c81b">与 PPO 类似，GRPO 采用裁剪目标，并直接加入 KL 惩罚项：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u97597d04" id="u97597d04" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd609bc96101d409dbec6d53d4364ef49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BuiBL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u182b411b" id="u182b411b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40f1d50f04bf115f8e6a5c20814caa8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ztsUX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u63c6ec3c"><li fid="u6373a66f" data-lake-id="u3a9875b5" id="u3a9875b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e87c40d" id="u3e87c40d">GRPO 在样本级别计算优化目标。具体而言，GRPO 首先计算每条生成序列内部的平均损失，再对不同样本的损失取平均</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u324cf0e3" id="u324cf0e3"><strong><span data-lake-id="uad2e58d5" id="uad2e58d5" style="color: #5C0036">KL 惩罚项用于约束在线策略与冻结的参考策略之间的偏离程度。在 RLHF 场景中，强化学习的目标是对齐模型行为，同时避免模型过度偏离初始模型。然而，在训练长思维链推理模型时，模型分布可能显著偏离初始模型，因此这一约束并非必要</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u8c956b3e" id="u8c956b3e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3f81d224" id="u3f81d224">使用奖励模型通常会面临奖励投机问题：直接将可验证任务中最终答案的正确性作为结果奖励</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u76fc2767" id="u76fc2767" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D%2Cy)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D1%2C%26%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(%5C%5Chat%7By%7D%2Cy)%5C%5C%5C%5C-1%2C%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf57b2a733b473f4d373401feadab8f8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JnRt4%22%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="ziIzQ" id="ziIzQ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1cfa49a9" id="u1cfa49a9">🍎</span><span data-lake-id="u6b67fab1" id="u6b67fab1"> 𝐃𝐞𝐜𝐨𝐮𝐩𝐥𝐞 𝐂𝐥𝐢𝐩 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐃𝐲𝐧𝐚𝐦𝐢𝐜 𝐬𝐀𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u7ea4cba7" id="u7ea4cba7"><span data-lake-id="u4ce51ddf" id="u4ce51ddf">解耦裁剪与动态采样策略优化算法：对于每个与答案</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F26fdbf8e53cb0e48da5f4ddd4aaf5a5c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WrdO9%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5db3a39f" id="u5db3a39f">配对的问题</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MC1zy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u316a2cd0" id="u316a2cd0">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a0a8c06" id="u9a0a8c06">DAPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubdd92023" id="ubdd92023"> 采样生成一组输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mucew%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00470b4b" id="u00470b4b">，并通过以下目标优化策略</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud9c6e3ce" id="ud9c6e3ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb95a2a8cfa43c57d60dfefed1bd4aa08.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LA24H%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3e406f83" id="u3e406f83" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20q%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D)%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2b227693d6f39562a6f384e4ce2dcec0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BQ17U%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub8b7f514" id="ub8b7f514"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5d634cf7" id="u5d634cf7" style="color: #70000D">在最初采用朴素 PPO 或 GRPO 的实验中，作者观察到熵坍塌现象：随着训练推进，策略的熵迅速下降。某些组内采样得到的回答趋于高度一致。这表明模型的探索受到限制，策略过早趋于确定性，从而可能阻碍训练规模的扩展</span></strong></p><ul list="u4acab3df"><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u1f7da7ec" id="u1f7da7ec"><span data-lake-id="u3ebb32b3" id="u3ebb32b3">提出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u49d01e76" id="u49d01e76">Clip-Higher</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46720eaf" id="u46720eaf"> 策略。裁剪近端策略优化通过对重要性采样比率进行裁剪来约束信赖域，从而增强强化学习的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u53093bb4" id="u53093bb4"><span data-lake-id="u2d9d8c6d" id="u2d9d8c6d">裁剪上界可能限制策略的探索：提高利用型 token 的概率相对容易，而低概率探索型 token 的概率提升却受到过于严格的约束</span></li><li fid="u90afc6ae" data-lake-id="u6f2069cd" id="u6f2069cd"><span data-lake-id="uc78b3be4" id="uc78b3be4">按照 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u99a1e9da" id="u99a1e9da">Clip-Higher</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc3531f20" id="uc3531f20"> 策略，将裁剪范围的下界参数与上界参数解耦，分别记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff3ac5e599a099ddb3c3ac5e4d24cbdd0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tXjFn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4a1832b" id="ud4a1832b">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fea2de2daf1e509ea35b73e5e728f7b7a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xZxTL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc369994e" id="uc369994e">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf144d032" id="uf144d032" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%7D%2C1%2B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F21561d9276e5cdcc48b9bee95c550a51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Oi6sd%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u1b116cd7" id="u1b116cd7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8deb2f7" id="ub8deb2f7" style="color: #70000D">当某些提示对应的准确率达到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AVPNO%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufaf48939" id="ufaf48939" style="color: #70000D">时，现有强化学习算法会面临梯度减弱的问题。以 GRPO 为例，如果某个提示的所有输出</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3e2cd2bf1d9bb56a5b2400a05e2fa121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uKHUg%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubcecfe46" id="ubcecfe46" style="color: #70000D">均正确，并获得相同的奖励，那么该组的优势就会为零。零优势会产生零策略梯度，从而减小批次梯度的幅度，并提高其对噪声的敏感性，最终降低样本效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u4741fc46"><li fid="u69e82e89" data-lake-id="u90a8b706" id="u90a8b706"><span data-lake-id="ua7f9de90" id="ua7f9de90">意味着每个批次中的有效提示数量不断减少，可能导致更大的梯度方差，并削弱模型训练的梯度信号</span></li><li fid="u69e82e89" data-lake-id="uaca548c5" id="uaca548c5"><span data-lake-id="ud44caac2" id="ud44caac2">提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73acd027" id="u73acd027">过采样，并过滤准确率为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vLraq%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub97903bb" id="ub97903bb">和</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d0feea96d3bb2fc273f7598ce748c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GAzbu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f5b615f" id="u7f5b615f">的提示</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u473a31ed" id="u473a31ed">。这样既能确保批次中的所有提示都提供有效梯度，也能保持提示数量一致。每个批次的采样成本是动态变化的。在进行训练之前持续采样，直到整个批次被准确率既不为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%220%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F22d0feea96d3bb2fc273f7598ce748c1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hSWlr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u667795ce" id="u667795ce">、也不为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnKwr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e0a6fe8" id="u5e0a6fe8">的样本填满</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue31a0b9d" id="ue31a0b9d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%26%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D0%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F86c0e637b70a4d59ef08bf0833ce9b33.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rubPJ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub7105b23"><li fid="ucbfa408e" data-lake-id="ua34b4633" id="ua34b4633"><span data-lake-id="uf8371168" id="uf8371168">这一策略并不一定会降低训练效率，因为当强化学习系统采用同步执行方式，且生成阶段未采用流水线时，生成耗时通常由长尾样本的生成过程所主导</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2b7a8e43" id="u2b7a8e43"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74026d0c" id="u74026d0c" style="color: #70000D">原始 GRPO 算法采用样本级损失计算方式：首先对每个样本内部各 token 的损失取平均，再对不同样本的损失进行聚合。在这种方式下，每个样本在最终损失计算中具有相同的权重。这种损失归约方式在长思维链强化学习场景中会带来若干挑战</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e230b85"><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u250687d6" id="u250687d6"><span data-lake-id="u904ea7b3" id="u904ea7b3">由于所有样本在损失计算中被赋予相同的权重，较长回答中的 token 对总体损失的贡献可能被不成比例地降低，从而产生不利影响</span></li><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u6aa95802" id="u6aa95802"><span data-lake-id="u1bd46de3" id="u1bd46de3">首先，对于高质量的长样本，这种效应可能妨碍模型学习其中与推理相关的模式。其次，过长的样本往往包含乱码和重复词语等低质量模式。因此，样本级损失计算无法有效惩罚长样本中的这些不良模式，进而导致熵和回答长度的不合理增长</span></li><li fid="uffd17ef8" data-lake-id="u937fb928" id="u937fb928"><span data-lake-id="ub405c5d5" id="ub405c5d5">为解决上述局限，在长思维链强化学习场景中引入 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0f47739" id="ue0f47739">Token 级策略梯度损失</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4e35f706" id="u4e35f706">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue3557d4b" id="ue3557d4b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BDAPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B(q%2Ca)%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%7Co_i%7C%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Ccolor%7Bred%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blow%7D%7D%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bhigh%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Bs.t.%7D%5C%5Cquad%260%3C%5C%5Cleft%7C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Ctexttt%7Bis%5C%5C_equivalent%7D(a%2Co_i)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright%7C%3CG.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc62990fad1125f2c8f6463ffff7d6789.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ejJR7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u3515807e"><li fid="u8c8b1a61" data-lake-id="ua5cde794" id="ua5cde794"><span data-lake-id="u31d86659" id="u31d86659">在这一设置下，相较于较短序列，较长序列能够对整体梯度更新产生更大的影响。此外，从单个 token 的角度来看，如果某种生成模式会导致奖励增加或减少，那么无论它出现在多长的回答中，都会受到同等程度的强化或抑制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u13fecc2b" id="u13fecc2b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6308c424" id="u6308c424" style="color: #70000D">在强化学习训练中，通常会设置最大生成长度，并据此截断超长样本。对截断样本进行不恰当的奖励塑形可能引入奖励噪声，并严重干扰训练过程</span></strong></p><ul list="ub0b4ea9b"><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="u586e327b" id="u586e327b"><span data-lake-id="u31b12b60" id="u31b12b60">默认情况下，会对截断样本赋予惩罚性奖励。然而，这种做法可能向训练过程引入噪声，因为一个合理的推理过程可能仅仅由于长度过长而受到惩罚。这类惩罚可能使模型对自身推理过程的有效性产生混淆</span></li><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="u42a90205" id="u42a90205"><span data-lake-id="u1e8f2b9e" id="u1e8f2b9e">为研究这种奖励噪声的影响，首先采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0b8e71a" id="uf0b8e71a">超长样本过滤</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueec1b584" id="ueec1b584">策略，屏蔽截断样本的损失。这一方法能够显著稳定训练并提升性能</span></li><li fid="u7705c559" data-lake-id="ueb293767" id="ueb293767"><span data-lake-id="u130c0ec1" id="u130c0ec1">进一步提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u94151d87" id="u94151d87">软性超长惩罚</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5600e8d3" id="u5600e8d3">。这是一种长度感知的惩罚机制，旨在对截断样本的奖励进行塑形。当回答长度超过预先设定的最大值时，定义一个惩罚区间。在该区间内，回答越长，受到的惩罚就越大。该惩罚会叠加到原有的基于规则的正确性奖励上，从而向模型传递避免生成过长回答的信号</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2ef45293" id="u2ef45293" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22R_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Blength%7D%7D(y)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D0%2C%26%7Cy%7C%5C%5Cleq%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cfrac%7B(L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D)-%7Cy%7C%7D%7BL_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%7D%2C%26L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcache%7D%7D%3C%7Cy%7C%5C%5Cleq%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb308ff1a29df3e32093fcbfb10af0145.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zAYbd%22%7D"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="VZMmK" id="VZMmK" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub75bd572" id="ub75bd572"> </span><span data-lake-id="u9c15b790" id="u9c15b790">🦦</span><span data-lake-id="ucbd361ea" id="ucbd361ea"> 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u5e7c4fd7" id="u5e7c4fd7"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="cq94d" id="cq94d" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua7063ffc" id="ua7063ffc">🐌</span><span data-lake-id="u91fb0b5d" id="u91fb0b5d"> 𝓐𝓵𝓰𝓸𝓻𝓲𝓽𝓱𝓶</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u65c5a808" id="u65c5a808"><span data-lake-id="u2c0c1131" id="u2c0c1131">token-level 重要性权重 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc5ca2b17fda9305d8fead2d032029e42.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XOJYn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6909f6e8" id="u6909f6e8">在 GRPO 中存在问题；在语言生成语境下，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud17de5fe" id="ud17de5fe">sequence-level</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u89120c77" id="u89120c77"> 重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F92b383f72a0279c04d6dd4f8f065d3b0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sDJVk%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf78efe67" id="uf78efe67"><span data-lake-id="u7f456888" id="u7f456888">具有清晰的理论含义：它反映从 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6313f1ae303641a36615a8eb6d79097.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ngbvk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69f238dd" id="u69f238dd">采样得到的响应 y 与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%20%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faad09c5dd05225b25e6da4bcba86796f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mz7JJ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udca5bc77" id="udca5bc77"> 的偏离程度，自然地与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u12c426c4" id="u12c426c4">序列级奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2c0bf426" id="u2c0bf426">对齐，也可作为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b55c5c5" id="u1b55c5c5">剪裁机制</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u142adb86" id="u142adb86">的有意义指示量</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5f13b435" id="u5f13b435"><span data-lake-id="u57f60faf" id="u57f60faf">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="u38d3cbc5" id="u38d3cbc5"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7ed9156" id="ua7ed9156" style="color: #DF2A3F">GSPO 的序列级优化目标</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4b45d852" id="u4b45d852" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%20%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Cmin%5C%5C!%5C%5CBig(%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Chat%20A_i%2C%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig(s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%5C%5C%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5C%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Chat%20A_i%20%5C%5CBig)%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23be599ce49fdc17febf19e0c3826bcd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Yr34h%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue087c90b" id="ue087c90b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20A_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5C%2Cr(x%2Cy_i)-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2C%7D%20%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D%5C%5Cbig(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cbig)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0086b58edd0942e410b6dff86573e460.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S3z5F%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u308aa2dd" id="u308aa2dd">.</span></p><p data-lake-id="u80e0405c" id="u80e0405c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5C!%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cexp%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7a5a71fff546d227fe487395ec5afa84.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mcskT%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf3d6f1a4"><li fid="u35908427" data-lake-id="u561d8bdf" id="u561d8bdf"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4ecbfef" id="uf4ecbfef">整段响应的剪裁</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3ae3f599" id="u3ae3f599">：GSPO 对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u54c1b31e" id="u54c1b31e">整段响应</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d9f790f" id="u6d9f790f">（而非单个 token）施加剪裁，以</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uceb00554" id="uceb00554">排除过度 off-policy</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3cba58ab" id="u3cba58ab"> 的样本进入梯度估计；这与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u60942371" id="u60942371">序列级奖励</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4d90b1f" id="ue4d90b1f">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u325ebae7" id="u325ebae7">序列级优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud628339f" id="ud628339f">相匹配</span></li><li fid="u35908427" data-lake-id="u8fe185a1" id="u8fe185a1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u061dde17" id="u061dde17">长度归一</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc70be4c3" id="uc70be4c3">：在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kwKkh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9e2de7ea" id="u9e2de7ea"> 中采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%7Cy_i%7C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe81cc1609301faee34d61854ee9f4c5f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FhN2t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae97abd6" id="uae97abd6">的归一，以</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc8788212" id="uc8788212">降低方差</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9e73b2aa" id="u9e73b2aa">并把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22p3u1O%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0686d22" id="uc0686d22">控制在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udcd03268" id="udcd03268">统一数值范围</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u82f543d7" id="u82f543d7">。否则，少数几个 token 的似然变化就可能造成</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub2f8fbf4" id="ub2f8fbf4">序列级比率的剧烈波动</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13ea0b57" id="u13ea0b57">；不同长度的响应也会需要</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8de0bde0" id="u8de0bde0">不同的剪裁区间</span></strong></li><li fid="u35908427" data-lake-id="u48d07d68" id="u48d07d68"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f232be0" id="u6f232be0">剪裁尺度差异</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub71f664c" id="ub71f664c">：由于 GSPO 与以往算法（如 GRPO）对重要性比率的定义</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u75e3d466" id="u75e3d466">不同</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3301157f" id="u3301157f">，二者在实践中的剪裁区间</span><strong><span data-lake-id="udb46ef8c" id="udb46ef8c">量级往往不同</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufce2a22f" id="ufce2a22f"><span data-lake-id="u1c7184b8" id="u1c7184b8">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="ud7aa370e" id="ud7aa370e"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c9963d9" id="u8c9963d9" style="color: #DF2A3F">GSPO 的梯度推导从无剪裁情形出发</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf108ca0a" id="uf108ca0a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign*%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_i%7Cx)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe04efb37f89c3042c46df8a871e92bdf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FViEe%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uc4add391"><li fid="u78ca1871" data-lake-id="ua0fa3fda" id="ua0fa3fda"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22na1KU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98aa2ffa" id="u98aa2ffa">为序列级重要性比率并做长度归一</span></li><li fid="u78ca1871" data-lake-id="uf5ce9440" id="uf5ce9440"><span data-lake-id="ud2e48be9" id="ud2e48be9">在序列 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F54507b6bac465d8afb0e218ccbf31b59.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aBNwB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udfc2f62b" id="udfc2f62b"> 内，所有 token 的 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9d77b9324f4ffa308b18160cd062d57b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SqRmv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u192466a2" id="u192466a2"> 共享同一个序列级权重 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%20A_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7db93adede4289bc438e09848a483384.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X6dLX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubaa3ae37" id="ubaa3ae37">，再做等权平均</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7fb0f69d" id="u7fb0f69d"><span data-lake-id="uc122cb78" id="uc122cb78">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="u399dd16a" id="u399dd16a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u89220a7b" id="u89220a7b" style="color: #DF2A3F">GRPO 的梯度对比</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uefe12d01" id="uefe12d01" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign*%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign*%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe76244cecd6ce9021155d8aa474e889b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22liCF4%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u216ae04c"><li fid="u5b951642" data-lake-id="u9d975e09" id="u9d975e09"><span data-lake-id="uaa367298" id="uaa367298">GRPO：每个 token 的梯度乘以其各自的重要性权重（并受剪裁）。这些不相等的权重会随训练推进在区间内大幅波动并累积影响，带来不可预测后果</span></li><li fid="u5b951642" data-lake-id="uef356766" id="uef356766"><span data-lake-id="uac009923" id="uac009923">GSPO：一个序列内所有 token 等权，从而消除 GRPO 中这一不稳定因素</span></li><li fid="u5b951642" data-lake-id="ubddb44b7" id="ubddb44b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua40f9202" id="ua40f9202" style="color: #664900">与奖励单位一致：GSPO 的序列级权重 + 序列级剪裁与序列级奖励天然对齐；配合长度归一，抑制由少量 token 似然大幅变化引起的序列比率剧烈波动</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u61d6d7ac" id="u61d6d7ac"><span data-lake-id="u34c4a7de" id="u34c4a7de">🎨</span><span data-lake-id="u60159fea" id="u60159fea"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f53d346" id="u4f53d346" style="color: #DF2A3F">GSPO-token A Token-level Objective Variant：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u63e38f74" id="u63e38f74" style="color: #000000">GSPO 的稳定离策略校正 + 逐 token 的优势控制</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8fa5f0e" id="ub8fa5f0e" style="color: #DF2A3F">  </span></strong></p><ul list="uf966d6df"><li fid="u1a9b3dfb" data-lake-id="ubc5cbf64" id="ubc5cbf64"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4df36279" id="u4df36279">在多轮对话等场景，我们可能需要比序列级更细的逐 token 优势调节。因此引入 GSPO-token，允许 token-wise 的优势自定义</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc26d4d6e" id="uc26d4d6e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cmin%20%5C%5Cleft(%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcb10ff8e48b00231117d1b32c792b019.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OddTD%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="ucf07a41b"><li fid="u30250a50" data-lake-id="ud1646fe5" id="ud1646fe5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uef079edc" id="uef079edc" style="color: #000000">比率定义与停梯度：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16100ad4" id="u16100ad4" style="color: #000000">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F565766aa7dad12254e0180dc38e60cc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22arz5J%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uc006b97d" id="uc006b97d" style="color: #000000">表示取数值但阻断梯度（PyTorch 的 </span><em><span data-lake-id="uda698991" id="uda698991" style="color: #000000">detach</span></em><span data-lake-id="ubbd2a4b2" id="ubbd2a4b2" style="color: #000000">）。注意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%2F%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F763c87c766a3b5a6cffdbcf34a187687.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cUX3c%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u195a9540" id="u195a9540" style="color: #000000"> 的数值为 1</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u40289734" id="u40289734" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cbig%5D%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cbig%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1c94e62c95363f51cf4975e74ebf1bc9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rGc0o%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="u1caa47ee"><li fid="u677bc9f5" data-lake-id="u0532f8df" id="u0532f8df"><strong><span data-lake-id="u37dc7fd5" id="u37dc7fd5" style="color: #000000">梯度推导</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3d94bf3c" id="u3d94bf3c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BCSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BE%7D_%7Bx%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_i%7Cx)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%7Cx)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cx%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F06aa1e1b8cdb3da1b8841389112222bc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eCEtH%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="uaf35daa5"><li fid="ucf4e2cae" data-lake-id="ue401d4b4" id="ue401d4b4"><span data-lake-id="u07c69a03" id="u07c69a03" style="color: #000000">当把同一响应的所有 token 的优势设为同一数值时，GSPO-token 与 GSPO 在优化目标、剪裁条件、理论梯度上均数值等价</span></li><li fid="ucf4e2cae" data-lake-id="u4fcd6f35" id="u4fcd6f35"><span data-lake-id="u7ccb9e21" id="u7ccb9e21" style="color: #000000">GSPO-token 的优势：在保持上述等价性的同时，提供逐 token 的优势灵活性，便于在多轮对话场景进行更细粒度的信用分配与调节</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="yDwJO" id="yDwJO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u98992b2e" id="u98992b2e">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u39c1b50c" id="u39c1b50c"> 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓐𝓭𝓪𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓟𝓸𝓵𝓲𝓬𝔂 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u104fced2" id="u104fced2"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4567a6d" id="ud4567a6d">1. 背景与挑战：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8799ce20" id="u8799ce20">强化学习（RL）在增强大语言模型（LLM）推理能力方面日益重要，但实现稳定且高性能的策略优化仍具挑战性。Token 级别的重要性比率通常表现出高方差，这种现象在混合专家（MoE）模型中更为严重，会导致更新不稳定</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3bc38ae1" id="u3bc38ae1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc6a8e61" id="ucc6a8e61">2. 现有方法的局限性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud5c4b334" id="ud5c4b334">现有的基于群组的策略优化方法（如 GSPO 和 GRPO）通过硬截断（hard clipping）来缓解上述问题，但这使得难以同时维持训练稳定性和有效学习 </span></p><p data-lake-id="ua5ce5be4" id="ua5ce5be4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u59e511ed" id="u59e511ed">3. 提出的方法：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufee4af97" id="ufee4af97">论文提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4ba7c8d9" id="u4ba7c8d9">软自适应策略优化（SAPO）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u173392df" id="u173392df">，用一种平滑的、温度控制的门控机制取代硬截断。该机制能自适应地衰减（减弱）偏离策略的更新，同时保留有用的学习信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u20476d44" id="u20476d44"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc05e8089" id="uc05e8089">4. SAPO 的核心优势与对比</span></strong></p><ul list="uf9df0648"><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="ube1089d8" id="ube1089d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0621fae5" id="u0621fae5">综合特性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u251c2dfd" id="u251c2dfd">相比 GSPO 和 GRPO，SAPO 兼具序列连贯性（sequence-coherent）和 Token 自适应性（token-adaptive）</span></li><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="ud031280c" id="ud031280c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue37e5390" id="ue37e5390">对比 GSPO：</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="uf9df0648" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u3944fee6" data-lake-id="u212c2e3a" id="u212c2e3a"><span data-lake-id="ud441b648" id="ud441b648">SAPO 像 GSPO 一样保持序列级连贯性，但其软门控形成一个连续的信任区域，避免 GSPO 中使用的脆弱硬截断带</span></li><li fid="u3944fee6" data-lake-id="u2c081d11" id="u2c081d11"><span data-lake-id="uef3803a1" id="uef3803a1">当一个序列包含少量高度偏离策略的 Token 时，GSPO 会抑制该序列的所有梯度；而 SAPO 仅选择性地降低那些违规 Token 的权重，并保留接近当前策略 Token 的学习信号，从而提高样本效率</span></li></ul><ul list="uf9df0648" start="3"><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="u15e127cc" id="u15e127cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22199424" id="u22199424">对比 GRPO：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua973b273" id="ua973b273">SAPO 将 GRPO 的硬性 Token 级截断替换为平滑的、温度控制的缩放，从而实现信息量更大且更稳定的更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua73812b6" id="ua73812b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1769300467954-9095561c-8c55-4c16-81f0-8f86e4066630.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6b9edf13-6032-4052-9453-759d0283316%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u084fe131-2f0a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A850.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A347%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A114135%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1675%2C%22originHeight%22%3A683%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIGURE1%3ACOMPARISONOFPOLICV-UPDATEOBIECTIVESUNDERPOSTIVEADVANTAGE.THELEFTPANELSHOWSTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A3%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A1666%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SUROGATEOBECTIVEVALUE%3BTHERIGHTPANELSHOWSTHECORRESPONDINGGRADIENTWEIGHT%2C(0LASAFUNCION%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A600%2C%22width%22%3A1666%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTHEPOLICYRATIOR(0).%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A637%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%8E%B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A235%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTGATE(T%3D3.O%22%2C%22x%22%3A1342%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARDCLIP%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TE(T%3D1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A829%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TE(T%3D2.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1115%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A411%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLIPPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTGA%22%2C%22x%22%3A759%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FGAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1059%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPINA%22%2C%22x%22%3A509%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A420%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I.(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1255%2C%22y%22%3A488%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22--UNC%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2208%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A854%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTG%22%2C%22x%22%3A1326%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A838%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A867%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A911%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A171%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub911bff4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub22142ef" id="ub22142ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ec8b80b" id="u5ec8b80b" style="color: #70000D">RL 为什么成为 LLM 后训练关键驱动力</span></strong></p><ul list="udc54cdfc"><li fid="u6ad5896c" data-lake-id="u531d2ece" id="u531d2ece"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue4cb5d89" id="ue4cb5d89">RL 已成为推动 LLM 近期进展的重要因素</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8705403e" id="u8705403e">，使模型在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c9a1c04" id="u9c9a1c04">数学、编程、多模态理解</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u45b5d785" id="u45b5d785">等高难任务上具备更深、更长的推理能力</span></li><li fid="u6ad5896c" data-lake-id="u934b869c" id="u934b869c"><span data-lake-id="u5cb7248f" id="u5cb7248f">在众多 RL 做法中，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucea8207a" id="ucea8207a">group-based policy optimization</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a06bc35" id="u1a06bc35"> 被认为是一个实用配方：对每个 query </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u131dcbd0" id="u131dcbd0">采样多个回复</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9036ee5d" id="u9036ee5d">，对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u85c0386d" id="u85c0386d">序列级 reward 做组内归一化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc82a8127" id="uc82a8127">，并用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9b3f7619" id="u9b3f7619">当前策略与行为策略之间的 importance ratio</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf36115d6" id="uf36115d6">对更新加权</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4deb95e9" id="u4deb95e9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u217a9778" id="u217a9778" style="color: #70000D">核心挑战：token-level importance ratio 高方差导致更新不稳</span></strong></p><ul list="uf863a30e"><li fid="u3c344a61" data-lake-id="u2c978e0f" id="u2c978e0f"><span data-lake-id="u26096813" id="u26096813">该范式下的中心难点是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8024497a" id="u8024497a">token-level importance ratio 的方差很高</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u730efc38" id="u730efc38">。这一问题在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ed3b5e4" id="u0ed3b5e4">MoE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7099b0ea" id="u7099b0ea"> 中更严重：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u810d4f30" id="u810d4f30">routing heterogeneity</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u051aa6fa" id="u051aa6fa"> 与 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc97757ae" id="uc97757ae">long responses</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubd495d09" id="ubd495d09"> 会放大 token 间偏差，从而提高不稳定更新概率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36b98eec" id="u36b98eec"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub2e57157" id="ub2e57157" style="color: #70000D">现有应对：hard clipping 的带宽两难</span></strong></p><ul list="u4bb20a33"><li fid="uf34d0aab" data-lake-id="uccba0ac0" id="uccba0ac0"><span data-lake-id="u8b927dbb" id="u8b927dbb">以 GRPO 为例，常用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5964e30" id="ue5964e30">hard clipping</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33d4fae2" id="u33d4fae2"> 来约束大偏差：当 ratio 超出固定 band 时，直接</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ce6d686" id="u6ce6d686">把梯度置零</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4acf58d8" id="u4acf58d8">以防止过大步长</span></li></ul><ul list="u80354e0f" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u8df50718" data-lake-id="u78f49a18" id="u78f49a18"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d701da9" id="u8d701da9">clip 太紧</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7f9b8cc" id="ue7f9b8cc">：有效样本（可用于梯度计算的 token/序列）变少</span></li><li fid="u8df50718" data-lake-id="u50955184" id="u50955184"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2abda732" id="u2abda732">clip 太松</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u54cc21ea" id="u54cc21ea">：off-policy 样本带来的噪声梯度进入更新，训练更不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueab8894d" id="ueab8894d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7970e9b6" id="u7970e9b6" style="color: #70000D">方法动机：SAPO 用软门控替代 hard clipping，构造连续信任域</span></strong></p><ul list="ud49816fc"><li fid="u3552a34f" data-lake-id="u7508b062" id="u7508b062"><span data-lake-id="u3da410d5" id="u3da410d5">为解决 hard clipping 的脆弱性，作者提出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2fb718bd" id="u2fb718bd">SAPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46e7e813" id="u46e7e813">：用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u45875eaf" id="u45875eaf">温度控制的 soft gate </span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8f29652" id="ud8f29652">替代 hard clipping</span></li><li fid="u3552a34f" data-lake-id="u2fc84702" id="u2fc84702"><span data-lake-id="ucabbba3c" id="ucabbba3c">对 token 更新按一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ad4aeb4" id="u5ad4aeb4">有界、sigmoid 形状</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc94adbb9" id="uc94adbb9">的函数加权，该函数以 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3dd5c50d" id="u3dd5c50d">on-policy 点（ratio≈1）为中心</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua59d41e0" id="ua59d41e0">。由此实现一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1514403" id="ua1514403">continuous trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucfe79ceb" id="ucfe79ceb">：</span></li></ul><ul list="u89b93807" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ub92f682e" data-lake-id="ub322beec" id="ub322beec"><span data-lake-id="u19a43745" id="u19a43745">在 on-policy 附近，梯度被保留以支持有效更新与探索</span></li><li fid="ub92f682e" data-lake-id="u7caaeee6" id="u7caaeee6"><span data-lake-id="u811fa425" id="u811fa425">ratio 偏离时，梯度</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uab59c959" id="uab59c959">平滑衰减而不是直接截断</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u47a1322c" id="u47a1322c">，从而在抑制噪声的同时，仍保留中等偏差样本的学习信号</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5af2c97c" id="u5af2c97c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0646867f" id="u0646867f" style="color: #70000D">关键细节：为何需要正/负 token 非对称温度</span></strong></p><ul list="u0a16b30c"><li fid="u7b91273a" data-lake-id="u7488726b" id="u7488726b"><span data-lake-id="ud9da97e9" id="ud9da97e9">作者进一步强调，为在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc292059" id="ucc292059">大词表</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a36df8f" id="u1a36df8f">下更稳健，SAPO 对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2bb5498" id="ua2bb5498">正 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u71bacda7" id="u71bacda7">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c4c44f7" id="u1c4c44f7">负 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50b28cbe" id="u50b28cbe">采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9ee65d5" id="ua9ee65d5">非对称温度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u54efc349" id="u54efc349">，让负 token 的梯度衰减更快</span></li><li fid="u7b91273a" data-lake-id="uce99594d" id="uce99594d"><span data-lake-id="u99d959b2" id="u99d959b2">引言给出的理由是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3fca364" id="ua3fca364">负向更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud2d13a2c" id="ud2d13a2c">往往会抬高许多不合适 token 的 logits，因此相比正向更新更容易引入不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf14e955d" id="uf14e955d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u843acd78" id="u843acd78" style="color: #70000D">方法定位：同时做到 sequence-coherent 与 token-adaptive</span></strong></p><ul list="u20c88fc2"><li fid="u8335c77d" data-lake-id="u901e315f" id="u901e315f"><span data-lake-id="u3189ec4a" id="u3189ec4a">在作者定义的常见条件下（</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2c87ef3" id="ua2c87ef3">on-policy 小步长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f5d4486" id="u1f5d4486"> + </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u708062d7" id="u708062d7">同一序列内 token log-ratio 低离散度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1ecea6d0" id="u1ecea6d0">），</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fa166e2" id="u6fa166e2">平均 token gate 会集中为一个平滑的序列级 gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u66646d96" id="u66646d96">，使优化与序列级 reward 对齐，风格上接近 GSPO</span></li><li fid="u8335c77d" data-lake-id="u8b31b103" id="u8b31b103"><span data-lake-id="u509a64a6" id="u509a64a6">当条件被破坏（存在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73052f84" id="u73052f84">异质 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u749862bf" id="u749862bf">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u82459b08" id="u82459b08">离群 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u69d33918" id="u69d33918">）时，SAPO 会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d0e25a4" id="u4d0e25a4">只下调 offending tokens</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3c06478" id="ue3c06478">，并保留同一序列内 near-on-policy token 的有效梯度；作者强调这能减少 hard clipping 带来的信号损失，从而提升采样效率并保持稳定更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0b008fbd" id="u0b008fbd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3641b483" id="u3641b483" style="color: #70000D">经验性结论</span></strong></p><ul list="u340b65cb"><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="ub3f861e9" id="ub3f861e9"><span data-lake-id="ue5ada856" id="ue5ada856">与 GSPO/GRPO 相比，SAPO 在经验上表现为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue59161c7" id="ue59161c7">更好的稳定性与任务性能</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3b337266" id="u3b337266">；尽管所有方法最终可能出现不稳定迹象，但 SAPO 能维持更久的 coherent learning，并在发散前达到更高 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u905e061a" id="u905e061a">Pass@1</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e708efa" id="u5e708efa">​</span></li><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="u97d1586e" id="u97d1586e"><span data-lake-id="u4b8e2be7" id="u4b8e2be7">温度消融进一步指出：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1838120b" id="u1838120b">负 token 用更大温度（让其梯度更快衰减）是关键</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7d854721" id="u7d854721">，能显著降低早期崩溃风险</span></li><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="u77988fd2" id="u77988fd2"><span data-lake-id="ubfd4021f" id="ubfd4021f">在更贴近真实系统的训练中，SAPO 也被用于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u38cf126b" id="u38cf126b">Qwen3-VL</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u914e2eff" id="u914e2eff"> 的实际训练，覆盖文本与多模态任务、不同规模与架构，作者称其同样有效</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="kxRjT" id="kxRjT" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1c00784a" id="u1c00784a">🪺</span><span data-lake-id="ua7ee99af" id="ua7ee99af"> 𝓟𝓻𝓮𝓵𝓲𝓶𝓲𝓷𝓪𝓻𝓲𝓮𝓼</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf7ba92ae" id="uf7ba92ae"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7a81bcf" id="ub7a81bcf" style="color: #70000D">基础符号定义 (Notation)</span></strong></p><ul list="u836dfe22"><li fid="u1d28b690" data-lake-id="u28fce97a" id="u28fce97a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b5c30b7" id="u3b5c30b7">模型建模：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u760c4e4b" id="u760c4e4b"> 将自回归大语言模型（LLM）建模为参数化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mivzF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4dfb87b9" id="u4dfb87b9">的随机策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZOWN%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u1d28b690" data-lake-id="ufb912a1b" id="ufb912a1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u27a4e05b" id="u27a4e05b">概率分解：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc1989382" id="uc1989382"> 给定查询</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OV4Ec%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc548368" id="ufc548368">，回复</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnKUV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16992ba4" id="u16992ba4">的生成概率被分解为所有 Token 条件概率的乘积：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%7Cq)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bt%7D%7Cq%2Cy_%7B%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8287f931641bf2f1d9c230376d8cca90.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QoKBS%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u020198a7" id="u020198a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c7a2ae9" id="u0c7a2ae9" style="color: #70000D">群组相对策略优化 (GRPO) 是目前主流的 RL 方法，其核心机制如下</span></strong></p><ul list="ud7ceb90d"><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u816f30b8" id="u816f30b8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u944e48f5" id="u944e48f5">群组采样 (Group Sampling)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub2910c9c" id="ub2910c9c"> 针对每个查询 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AhtU2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb63ab59" id="udb63ab59">，从旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd02a7b0f54603f2316cbd320fbc15bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X8YMq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4b2a092" id="uc4b2a092">中采样一组</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8df64a4bfdeb9bdcbc357668b6fb123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IR8cl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f9be3fc" id="u6f9be3fc"> 个 回复 </span></li><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u97900182" id="u97900182"><strong><span data-lake-id="u01108f78" id="u01108f78">群组归一化优势 (Group-normalized Advantage)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u79c26a83" id="u79c26a83"> 不使用额外的 Critic 模型，而是通过计算组内奖励的均值和标准差来归一化计算优势值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F371e861621451c9ece01c17da6460419.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TeRft%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf096bda0" id="uf096bda0">。这意味着同一个回复中的所有 Token 共享同一个优势值</span></li><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u6f581c6c" id="u6f581c6c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0434a04a" id="u0434a04a">Token 级硬截断：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a6b51a3" id="u1a6b51a3"> 优化目标是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5efa12ed" id="u5efa12ed">Token 级别</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udc7ed7c4" id="udc7ed7c4"> 的。它计算每个 Token 的重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4323480e5da85abf6a01751172ceb51c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ivHSc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u974fbd67" id="u974fbd67">，并使用 PPO 风格的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3c7870f" id="uf3c7870f">硬截断 (Hard Clipping)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd7435a2" id="udd7435a2"> 将其限制在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1-%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cepsilon%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18019f476bfde1722b8e0d074f8cd5d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CFaJV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0b15974" id="ua0b15974">范围内，以防止更新步长过大</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u48c507bd" id="u48c507bd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cmin%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab4d9e6a8b6541f28b55bdf3e93d876e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CK91T%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udf2c56cd" id="udf2c56cd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i%20-%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f66ee29d15c3a05114f48625fceed01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VIvnT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9a8f48b7" id="u9a8f48b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8375d6ad" id="u8375d6ad" style="color: #70000D">群组序列策略优化 (GSPO) 是另一种基于序列的方法：</span></strong></p><ul list="ud496c5b8"><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="u07858337" id="u07858337"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f4e54a5" id="u7f4e54a5">序列级优化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u465a6c6f" id="u465a6c6f">与 GRPO 不同，GSPO 采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d021fab" id="u3d021fab">序列级别 (Sequence-level)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc7b37b50" id="uc7b37b50"> 的优化目标</span></li><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="ua65927b5" id="ua65927b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2d02d15" id="ua2d02d15">长度归一化比率：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufc60fab9" id="ufc60fab9">它定义一个序列级的重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F328f7a092a27394bc8cc996e32331875.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DXhrr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34ef8b0e" id="u34ef8b0e">，这是 Token 级比率的几何平均值（经过长度归一化）。这种处理方式降低方差，使得不同长度的回复在数值上更一致</span></li><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="u9c530718" id="u9c530718"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0097af70" id="u0097af70">序列级截断：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u72fcfa8f" id="u72fcfa8f"> GSPO 对这个序列级比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F328f7a092a27394bc8cc996e32331875.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MV4pS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68cb3e3e" id="u68cb3e3e">进行截断，而不是对每个单独的 Token 进行截断</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5f0d7111" id="u5f0d7111" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cmin%20%5C%5Cleft(%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc601d50b8756e7fc172f6293e1549936.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22adz2X%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc32ccafe" id="uc32ccafe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%7Cq)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i%20-%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff97f5c7e3d11a8c69d7475e751187942.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mxkDX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7e2c7215" id="u7e2c7215"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4880fb4d" id="u4880fb4d" style="color: #70000D">总结对比</span></strong></p><ul list="u4a16e9ea"><li fid="uff5a5d21" data-lake-id="u3cc2c912" id="u3cc2c912"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39880ab1" id="u39880ab1">GRPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4a002435" id="u4a002435">：token 级硬剪裁 → band 外 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uec1f6be0" id="uec1f6be0">token 直接 0 梯度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0973a1e9" id="u0973a1e9">，稳定/效率靠 ε 走钢丝</span></li><li fid="uff5a5d21" data-lake-id="ua137fbd1" id="ua137fbd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u38f6f409" id="u38f6f409">GSPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908d0280" id="u908d0280">：序列级硬机制 → 少数异常 token 会让</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0c88e6a" id="uc0c88e6a">整句梯度被压掉</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub9c7ae2b" id="ub9c7ae2b">，缺少 token 级自适应</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="oAKGW" id="oAKGW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua510c35e" id="ua510c35e"> </span><span data-lake-id="u696d0f5b" id="u696d0f5b">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u3d1b26c4" id="u3d1b26c4"> 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓐𝓭𝓪𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓟𝓸𝓵𝓲𝓬𝔂 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uced90e68" id="uced90e68"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6641b029" id="u6641b029" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">SAPO 的定位：用于 LLM 的 RL 微调，是一种平滑 + 自适应的 policy-gradient 方法，用温度控制的 soft gate（软门控）替换 group-based 方法里常见的 hard clipping（硬截断）</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7c118119" id="u7c118119"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65cc31f8" id="u65cc31f8">大模型训练必需的扩展</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue83570b0" id="ue83570b0">：</span></p><ul list="u35be44b2"><li fid="uaea69512" data-lake-id="u67bb5165" id="u67bb5165"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74d13c7d" id="u74d13c7d">token-level soft trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e351416" id="u8e351416">（token 级软信任域），并且它会自然地产生 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u465fa8ca" id="u465fa8ca">sequence-level coherence</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub64f60be" id="ub64f60be">（序列级一致性）</span></li><li fid="uaea69512" data-lake-id="u59a595b3" id="u59a595b3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub285aaec" id="ub285aaec">asymmetric temperature</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u229fd0fe" id="u229fd0fe">（非对称温度）：针对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u05df6354" id="u05df6354">正/负 token 更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6cd27ef8" id="u6cd27ef8">行为不同而设计</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud6a5af2c" id="ud6a5af2c"><span data-lake-id="u195d2796" id="u195d2796">🧱</span><span data-lake-id="u17fd42b7" id="u17fd42b7"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u269e7581" id="u269e7581">SAPO 最大化下面的目标函数：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf4ef4947" id="uf4ef4947" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12fe6b6413ae2e55e52ea9db3bf4e6aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s8cdJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2c13cb3f" id="u2c13cb3f"><span data-lake-id="u53366f6d" id="u53366f6d">🧱</span><span data-lake-id="u1421cf98" id="u1421cf98"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e19bf2f" id="u2e19bf2f">其中 gate（门控）函数定义为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud25a45c9" id="ud25a45c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20(x%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3E%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5344114f00d4fe0994d8ae7ab436468.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MyzgG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2e73eed6" id="u2e73eed6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e3e7b14" id="u2e3e7b14" style="color: #70000D">对目标求导后的梯度形式与软信任域的含义： 给出一个带权重的 log-policy gradient：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uac7bb3a8" id="uac7bb3a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6baa3a5b52f3757ff64ecc567997b9ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRlre%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u247ecec4" id="u247ecec4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%204%20%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cleft(1%20-%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc68b2f5854555a4fc988ce3705e1425f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ba9VP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub5068621"><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="uad034767" id="uad034767"><span data-lake-id="u1d7e985d" id="u1d7e985d">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dfbb2538d3ba951541028f33bcaecb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CiC5F%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25103194" id="u25103194">在 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GhR6P%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec34cf45" id="uec34cf45">处取峰值 1</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u984d37af" id="u984d37af">，当 ratio 偏离 1 时会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a4e8df4" id="u6a4e8df4">平滑衰减</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d421f53" id="u6d421f53">（并且近似指数衰减）</span></li><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="uae96208b" id="uae96208b"><span data-lake-id="u90de0a60" id="u90de0a60">实现一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe0e8d17" id="ufe0e8d17">soft trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ccbf889" id="u0ccbf889">：偏离小 → 梯度保留；偏离大 → 梯度连续变小，而不是突然截断为 0。</span></li><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="u1202497d" id="u1202497d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3904f272" id="u3904f272">关键不变性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u44258654" id="u44258654">：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x1CWs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7996b4b" id="ue7996b4b">时，soft gate 的梯度与未截断目标的梯度</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8dadf88" id="ud8dadf88">相同</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub28c9f00" id="ub28c9f00">，而且</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a937ba7" id="u0a937ba7">与 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0660784ae953829ecc20c4e1eb836f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bKAPY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b2294e8" id="u1b2294e8"> 无关</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u197a00b1" id="u197a00b1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u961bf4f5" id="u961bf4f5" style="color: #70000D">对比结论：同时具备 sequence-coherent 与 token-adaptive</span></strong></p><ul list="u33634954"><li fid="ubd8d8c94" data-lake-id="u2ebb705d" id="u2ebb705d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uccc96511" id="uccc96511">相对 GSPO：SAPO 在温和条件下会收敛为序列级门控形式。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf90751aa" id="uf90751aa">在小步长 on-policy + 序列内 token log-ratio 离散度低的假设下，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u308a9ce0" id="u308a9ce0">平均 token gate 会集中为一个平滑的 sequence gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0d72cb62" id="u0d72cb62">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ec086d2" id="u6ec086d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe897258afa32f51892d34a069185fbce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VjZK7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u637b26dc" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uc2c59ad4" data-lake-id="uf6da9171" id="uf6da9171"><span data-lake-id="ua2991dd4" id="ua2991dd4">因而 SAPO 像 GSPO 一样能对齐 sequence reward，但区别是：SAPO 的信任域是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11a843a6" id="u11a843a6">连续</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02927088" id="u02927088">的，不是 GSPO 的 hard clipping band</span></li><li fid="uc2c59ad4" data-lake-id="u83a9f5bb" id="u83a9f5bb"><span data-lake-id="ub8ca4049" id="ub8ca4049">当序列里只有少数 token 极端 off-policy 把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99fef66755b65b72ae46f4fdc159c96e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4qiy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a9aaea5" id="u2a9aaea5">推出 GSPO 的硬带宽时，GSPO 会把这条序列的很多近 on-policy token 梯度也一起压掉；SAPO 则只下调违规 token，保留其余 token 的学习信号</span></li></ul><ul list="u637b26dc"><li fid="ud1233e7d" data-lake-id="u0595cc58" id="u0595cc58"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecd041f8" id="uecd041f8">相对 GRPO：SAPO 避免 token 级 hard clipping 的超界即置零。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf9a71aab" id="uf9a71aab">GRPO 在固定范围外会把 token 梯度直接置零；SAPO 则是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u639f9cc7" id="u639f9cc7">连续缩放</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8babaf6" id="ud8babaf6">，更平衡地保留有用信号 + 防止不稳定的大步长</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0cea1abd" id="u0cea1abd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u639ff083" id="u639ff083" style="color: #70000D">为什么要给正/负 advantage 用不同温度</span></strong></p><ul list="u88feb85f"><li fid="u044e9a23" data-lake-id="u33fcfcb7" id="u33fcfcb7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f731b0d" id="u2f731b0d">负向 token 更新通常比正向更不稳定</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u968f7dc5" id="u968f7dc5">，并从梯度如何在 logits 上传播来解释。设 logits 向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%3D%5Bz_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cz_%7B%7CV%7C%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b8b33d5bfdfe37fe7c7c87d7483ff2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ixPEV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5407e19" id="ua5407e19">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IVxrV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubab4b30d" id="ubab4b30d"> 为任意 token；softmax 概率：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5778b4d9" id="u5778b4d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(v%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%20%2F%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F926f54e6cefe4e1999212ab21fd97594.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TzpM8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u88feb85f" start="2"><li fid="u044e9a23" data-lake-id="u061f71a1" id="u061f71a1"><span data-lake-id="u8c739be9" id="u8c739be9"> 给出对任意 logit </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf0dea4b5076efaabfe025da521ff57b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OdKz8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub35462f5" id="ub35462f5"> 的偏导，最后化简成下面的分段形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u01c71e2a" id="u01c71e2a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BI%7D(v%20%3D%20y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%7D%7B(%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D))%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D))%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20v%20%3D%20y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(sampled%20token)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20-%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(v%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(unsampled%20token)%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81edbc0103ccdec2c1139e10d7093189.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rtli6%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub4b02446" id="ub4b02446"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3781c090" id="u3781c090">1. 超参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Omo21%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9976314" id="ue9976314">的作用：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aXYHA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e25045e" id="u5e25045e">控制权重的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cb7c676" id="u7cb7c676">衰减速率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8a048e6f" id="u8a048e6f">：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJtvH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7b825e8" id="ud7b825e8">值越大，当新旧策略出现偏差时，权重下降得越快（即门控关得越紧，过滤越严格）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1d858964" id="u1d858964"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1fc4780" id="ua1fc4780">2. 负向样本的不稳定性（核心原因）</span></strong></p><ul list="u59086bf6"><li fid="u31e8b269" data-lake-id="u6d7a778d" id="u6d7a778d"><span data-lake-id="u753387c3" id="u753387c3">虽然负向 Token（即模型预测错误的词）对于探索和防止过拟合很重要，但它们比正向 Token 更容易引入训练的不稳定性</span></li><li fid="u31e8b269" data-lake-id="ueb8d29fe" id="ueb8d29fe"><strong><span data-lake-id="u241a2ca4" id="u241a2ca4">数学机制（Softmax 的挤压效应）：</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="u59086bf6" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ud56297d1" data-lake-id="u8f86aca9" id="u8f86aca9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b47b3b9" id="u5b47b3b9">正向更新（Positive）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc69a7f53" id="uc69a7f53"> 提高目标 Token 的 Logit 值，自然压低其他所有未采样 Token 的值，这通常是聚焦且安全的</span><span data-lake-id="uf98552dd" id="uf98552dd">。</span></li><li fid="ud56297d1" data-lake-id="u192dc1b5" id="u192dc1b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf630b9d0" id="uf630b9d0">负向更新（Negative）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0efff8e3" id="u0efff8e3"> 降低目标 Token 的 Logit 值。由于概率总和为 1，这会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a9454c0" id="u1a9454c0">被迫提高所有其他未采样 Token 的 Logit 值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd8616b6" id="ucd8616b6">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf3063e59" id="uf3063e59"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc3f022b" id="ucc3f022b">3. 大词表环境下的风险</span></strong></p><ul list="uee8846a6"><li fid="u31f84fe7" data-lake-id="uf1636f73" id="uf1636f73"><span data-lake-id="uef1358a7" id="uef1358a7">LLM 的词表非常大（通常数十万个 Token），而正确的 Token 往往只有少数几个</span><span data-lake-id="ufd5601e2" id="ufd5601e2">。</span></li><li fid="u31f84fe7" data-lake-id="uc3571392" id="uc3571392"><span data-lake-id="u425dfded" id="u425dfded">负向更新会将梯度扩散到成千上万个不相关的 Token 上。这种盲目的概率提升虽然有一定正则化作用，但在策略偏离（Off-policy）时极易引入噪声和不稳定性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3772dc29" id="u3772dc29"><strong><span data-lake-id="u19456d88" id="u19456d88">4.  为解决上述问题，SAPO 设定负向温度大于正向温度 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7Bneg%7D%20%3E%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bpos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73e1f7065dcb74bb8bd0979fe66d8782.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lCfhk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30007de0" id="u30007de0">。这意味着对负向更新实施</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua43efa53" id="ua43efa53">更严格的门控</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8ca2aaa4" id="u8ca2aaa4">：一旦策略稍有偏离，负向梯度的权重就会迅速衰减。这在保留有效惩罚信号的同时，极大降低引发模型崩溃的风险</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="oWWA8" id="oWWA8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub14632ca" id="ub14632ca">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="ua9573ffd" id="ua9573ffd"> 𝓐 𝓖𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓷𝓰-𝓕𝓾𝓷𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷 𝓟𝓮𝓻𝓼𝓹𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓸𝓷 𝓢𝓐𝓟𝓞𝓼 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓷𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷𝓼 𝓽𝓸 𝓖𝓡𝓟𝓞 𝓪𝓷𝓭 𝓖𝓢𝓟𝓞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u66f5d137" id="u66f5d137"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8441efda" id="u8441efda">统一 surrogate 目标， 其中差异全部被塞进 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c8085c4c4c53958fe2b374e7d5400cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axokr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u995e8bed" id="u995e8bed">：不同算法就是选不同的 gating function  </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u576617b3" id="u576617b3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12fe6b6413ae2e55e52ea9db3bf4e6aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MnzJ9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6c4b471d" id="u6c4b471d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub30cc00e" id="ub30cc00e">把 token ratio 汇总成 sequence ratio，并构造一个可分配到 token 的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nOrGL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61d681fd" id="u61d681fd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsg%7D%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ff6a833d7c8d7683289b0943e37c893.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HSEub%22%7D"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id="ua7bbda69" id="ua7bbda69" style="padding-left: 2em"><p data-lake-id="uf39824b5" id="uf39824b5"><span data-lake-id="ue20052b4" id="ue20052b4">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc14e957f90275d3b533ef99205dd928c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RcXJb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf07434d4" id="uf07434d4">是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3393dbc" id="uc3393dbc">stop-gradient</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud87b612c" id="ud87b612c">。这一步的作用是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6e4e211" id="ue6e4e211">让 GSPO 这种序列级 ratio 也能写成 token 求和形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u41c17f2e" id="u41c17f2e">，并且通过 stop-gradient 控制梯度只沿希望的路径传播</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u85b939ee" id="u85b939ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua96db788" id="ua96db788">三种算法各自的 gating function</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2ce5de2c" id="u2ce5de2c">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3811ecc" id="uf3811ecc">GSPO 的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sic30%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1cae51a" id="ud1cae51a">在同一序列内对 token 不变（token-invariant）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u10130965" id="u10130965">，而 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6cb18b3b" id="u6cb18b3b">SAPO/GRPO 是 token-dependent</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub9def2c0" id="ub9def2c0">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="uce6db41f" id="uce6db41f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctau_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmin(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmax(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%5C%5Cequiv%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bseq%7D%7D(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmin(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmax(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200.%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cb615c0efcd732e792a2082056d46be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G8lXn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf4585539" id="uf4585539"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc79e07df" id="uc79e07df">统一梯度形式， 得到 SAPO/GRPO 共享的梯度模板</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="udd525700" id="udd525700" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f'_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd80278daf7e303052b082b398f9d850c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cjZUG%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="bhpqT" id="bhpqT" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u29efa489" id="u29efa489">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u0478db0d" id="u0478db0d"> 𝓢𝓐𝓟𝓞–𝓖𝓢𝓟𝓞 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓷𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷: 𝓡𝓮𝓭𝓾𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷 𝓽𝓸 𝓪 𝓢𝓮𝓺𝓾𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮-𝓛𝓮𝓿𝓮𝓵 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓖𝓪𝓽𝓮</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ua9efbab4" id="ua9efbab4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u025c56ab" id="u025c56ab">1）</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f23a562" id="u1f23a562" style="color: #70000D">SAPO 的 token 级软门控（梯度权重）的解析式利用恒等式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u730e8bee" id="u730e8bee" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(x)(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma(x))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B(e%5E%7Bx%2F2%7D%20%2B%20e%5E%7B-x%2F2%7D)%5E2%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2(x%2F2)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ef25b7df58760d67a0475731ba21b61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZkUTj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5d5cc46e" id="u5d5cc46e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%204%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%20%5C%5Cleft(%201%20-%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb6278d76f5d20063d6674a1273e24e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yjR5M%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u30606c09" id="u30606c09"><span data-lake-id="u6d3bae3f" id="u6d3bae3f"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f589517" id="u6f589517">2）</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a4d4ff6" id="u8a4d4ff6" style="color: #70000D">两个关键假设</span></strong></p><ul list="u5869a6ff"><li fid="u59e94fc0" data-lake-id="ude03a75b" id="ude03a75b"><span data-lake-id="u931075b1" id="u931075b1"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc87f2e9a" id="uc87f2e9a">假设 (A1) 小步长/当前策略 (Small-step/on-policy) ，新旧策略差异很小</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua7044ab1" id="ua7044ab1">，即重要性比率 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b807d1513e34fd6f30ec5bcb785cc11.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lCRLe%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8e3dc986" id="u8e3dc986" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Capprox%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa34d316270e815828affba8b5906d6d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CU0mW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udd0efbfe"><li fid="ua2d2008e" data-lake-id="u00d7e0b7" id="u00d7e0b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74a789b7" id="u74a789b7">假设 (A2) 低序列内离散度 (Low intra-sequence dispersion)，</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uec01d2a3" id="uec01d2a3">定义 Token 的对数比率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F114908aedc4e9ed593fe70c9890980ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BHbvB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd1c6754" id="ubd1c6754">，序列的平均对数比率为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7700ed6beb62ef79b8d10dad00a96630.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wv8td%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64694d1f" id="u64694d1f">，假设序列内的方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cd2bc6de14a2b8f6022ff0f2507e867.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YY16J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9b9b74e" id="ub9b9b74e"> 很小：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9826a15f" id="u9826a15f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%20%5C%5Capprox%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F473e5acb05fe89881bf50c1ac7640f1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FPskn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2662b87e" id="u2662b87e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%3A%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce54bb5dff4f8cef1158e7aba74db3d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZZiPR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u675e0ba0" id="u675e0ba0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d77b6d7" id="u2d77b6d7" style="color: #70000D">3）token 门控均值 ⇒ 序列门控：二阶泰勒展开</span></strong></p><ul list="uafcb2a5c"><li fid="uc1faa1ae" data-lake-id="u0b505506" id="u0b505506"><span data-lake-id="uaea3e473" id="uaea3e473">对光滑函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb0b964b494ebaeee0e1491f4616abb5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gJPXK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94ae6b96" id="u94ae6b96">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52b28c3656f0c2bab251e8332a60b813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zyalk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5322d840" id="u5322d840">处做二阶泰勒展开：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u46f5710c" id="u46f5710c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20g'_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8512bdef27718f64a3472eeb2bed9b29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Btrh6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e386992" id="u2e386992">  </span></p><ul list="ucfb7973d"><li fid="u50ca008c" data-lake-id="u5dd20556" id="u5dd20556"><span data-lake-id="u7a158900" id="u7a158900"> 其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff602bfb77c7ac7b5055c8d2e0114ce98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IwOt5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e03f077" id="u6e03f077">介于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F802b10177b5452ae182f5083e83a031b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s7yXT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b91aadd" id="u5b91aadd">与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F046ae87323d03a070a9d750f0d1ce898.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nxBxG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf367e914" id="uf367e914">之间。对 token 求平均后，一阶项因中心化而抵消：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue19e4e3a" id="ue19e4e3a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1290347fb8fdda6a47d411ccade35941.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RPOoX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uebad2bba" id="uebad2bba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u209ed26b" id="u209ed26b" style="color: #70000D">4）二阶导的显式形式与统一误差界</span></strong></p><ul list="u7c2bab57"><li fid="u7b9107e9" data-lake-id="u70ff6bdf" id="u70ff6bdf"><span data-lake-id="ud165eae3" id="ud165eae3"> 令 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%5C%5Ctau(z)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E2(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff36693c34575e26ce12385d01143f9a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sLlTI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf46dbf71" id="uf46dbf71"> 且 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Ctau%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8739bf2ba31792129aea460bc986d418.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c0hlF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf695f0c7" id="uf695f0c7">，则可直接计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u024fe524" id="u024fe524" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%204%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%20-%206%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E4(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csup_z%20%7Cg''_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%7C%20%3D%202%5C%5Calpha%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau%5E2%7D%7B2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F469bbd7e2aa0e6f6843946c6845a3734.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VRLoW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7c2bab57" start="2"><li fid="u7b9107e9" data-lake-id="u8a52a1df" id="u8a52a1df"><span data-lake-id="u161e823e" id="u161e823e"> 因此，token 门控均值与序列门控的偏差可用统一上界控制：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue4fecec2" id="ue4fecec2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20-%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Csup_z%20%7Cg''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z)%7C%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%5E2%7D%7B4%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffefd3e4343e1a826e0711c82225b1fde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kXq2g%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue555a7cd" id="ue555a7cd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d85ec20" id="u3d85ec20" style="color: #70000D">5）从 token 级梯度近似推到序列级梯度（得到 GSPO-like 形式） </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99106537" id="u99106537"> </span></p><ul list="ua3dc8a83"><li fid="u9e3dcb0b" data-lake-id="u4e3f3416" id="u4e3f3416"><span data-lake-id="uc2081e65" id="uc2081e65"> 从通用梯度形式出发，取 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3978485e598dcf1f6cece33ee8dd819.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eOmSw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7959a4f3" id="u7959a4f3">，SAPO 的梯度可近似为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u97847826" id="u97847826" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc1188a0dcc570e91329a3a845874659.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Myofr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ued8f1909"><li fid="uda303c67" data-lake-id="u0b9d894a" id="u0b9d894a"><span data-lake-id="u590901ac" id="u590901ac"> 再由 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_t%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Capprox%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F872e39883d39f6a2fdebe862db6e6966.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KDTPv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufef0f358" id="ufef0f358">，于是 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uccefa92e" id="uccefa92e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D%20%26%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d4d18bed378d4577deb068d580303ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WOpBX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5adab3ce"><li fid="u3d8635b5" data-lake-id="u33de68c3" id="u33de68c3"><span data-lake-id="ufec56ee2" id="ufec56ee2"> SAPO 退化为与 GSPO 结构相似的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06b9a87d" id="u06b9a87d">序列级更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufbc6c7e2" id="ufbc6c7e2">，但门控是连续软门控：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9807dee9" id="u9807dee9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.n