t%22%3A%2220000%22%2C%22x%22%3A480%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VAR(E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1068%2C%22y%22%3A318%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.004%22%2C%22x%22%3A916%2C%22y%22%3A102%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22000%22%2C%22x%22%3A494%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A28%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A47%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A328%2C%22y%22%3A293%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A532%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LE9%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A15%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A46%2C%22y%22%3A581%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A226%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2201F%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A784%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22x%22%3A387%2C%22y%22%3A791%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.005%22%2C%22x%22%3A922%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A50%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A23%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A58%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A255%2C%22y%22%3A294%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A455%2C%22y%22%3A646%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A897%2C%22y%22%3A649%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A227%2C%22y%22%3A792%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.5%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A728%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.8%22%2C%22x%22%3A119%2C%22y%22%3A292%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A464%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A454%2C%22y%22%3A624%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4f58e9a6%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2085ba2a"><li fid="uf7710f2c" data-lake-id="u00936c61" id="u00936c61"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52f7ee49" id="u52f7ee49">结论：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6518f1b7" id="u6518f1b7">实验证明这两个假设在绝大多数情况下成立。这意味着误差界限</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd5ff3156919bdd99abe0417dd4f365d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UhY7c%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc7a73202" id="uc7a73202">很小，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u78ea01b2" id="u78ea01b2">SAPO 的平均 Token 门控确实可以被序列级门控良好地近似</span></strong></li><li fid="uf7710f2c" data-lake-id="u514b0b38" id="u514b0b38"><strong><span data-lake-id="u77d6dd01" id="u77d6dd01">基于上述理论和验证，作者总结 SAPO 优于 GSPO 的两点：</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="u7b4c62d3" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uf5e4d96a" data-lake-id="u8aea276b" id="u8aea276b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3addfde" id="ua3addfde">优势一：平滑性与稳定性 (Smoothness and Stability)。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufded8c28" id="ufded8c28">SAPO 的软门控随序列偏差连续变化，避免 GSPO 硬截断（Hard Clipping）带来的不连续性，从而减少优化过程中的噪声 </span></li><li fid="uf5e4d96a" data-lake-id="u241f437b" id="u241f437b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u906d3a19" id="u906d3a19">优势二：兼具序列连贯性与 Token 自适应性 (Adaptivity with Coherence)</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="u7b4c62d3" data-lake-indent="2"><li fid="u3f79f729" data-lake-id="u8e87987d" id="u8e87987d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u859390a8" id="u859390a8">常规状态（Sequence-level）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6c584140" id="u6c584140">在满足假设 (A1)/(A2) 时，SAPO 表现得像一个序列级方法，保证生成的连贯性</span></li><li fid="u3f79f729" data-lake-id="ufb076764" id="ufb076764"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e99efb1" id="u6e99efb1">异常状态（Token-level）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5eb87e46" id="u5eb87e46">当条件被破坏（例如出现异质 Token 或离群值）时，SAPO 会自动退回到 Token 级门控。它能选择性地降低离群 Token 的权重，同时保留好的 Token。相比之下，GSPO 在这种情况下会一刀切地抑制整条序列，导致有效信息的丢失</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id="P3u7i" id="P3u7i" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u4a92b3d8" id="u4a92b3d8">🍁</span><span data-lake-id="u6a067828" id="u6a067828"> 𝓢𝓐𝓟𝓞–𝓖𝓡𝓟𝓞 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓷𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷: 𝓢𝓶𝓸𝓸𝓽𝓱 𝓣𝓸𝓴𝓮𝓷 𝓖𝓪𝓽𝓮𝓼 𝓿𝓼. 𝓗𝓪𝓻𝓭 𝓣𝓸𝓴𝓮𝓷 𝓒𝓵𝓲𝓹𝓹𝓲𝓷𝓰</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ue36ea436" id="ue36ea436"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7efa76df" id="u7efa76df" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">用门控函数视角说明：GRPO 的 token-level clipping 本质是一个二值（all-or-nothing）的信任域；SAPO 把它换成连续的软门控，从而更稳定</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue99f9875" id="ue99f9875"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea6afad0" id="uea6afad0" style="color: #70000D">1）GRPO：分段硬门控 ⇒ band 外梯度直接为 0  </span></strong></p><ul list="ufe648d49"><li fid="u2aaebb11" data-lake-id="u6ef49786" id="u6ef49786"><span data-lake-id="uc9bb9f08" id="uc9bb9f08"> 在 GRPO 中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F497b16a9afe302f61838b0da154a622e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R95OM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42d2111a" id="u42d2111a">相对 clipping 区间是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud71a79cb" id="ud71a79cb">分段常数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud44f07fc" id="ud44f07fc">，对其求导得到  </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc915168c" id="uc915168c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn1%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cle%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3E%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn1%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cge%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn0%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8661a8a0ebc79404c4f58a24b7584025.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uZjAh%22%7D"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id="u7b106379" id="u7b106379" style="padding-left: 2em"><p data-lake-id="u6023fac3" id="u6023fac3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8b996a7" id="ud8b996a7">GRPO 采用二值 trust region </span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2451b27" id="ue2451b27">—— </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb64b3fe" id="ucb64b3fe">band 内</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u890d4ffd" id="u890d4ffd">：token 的梯度与未截断目标一致；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uddb6c87d" id="uddb6c87d">band 外</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u22e60393" id="u22e60393">：token </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue097d7d8" id="ue097d7d8">零梯度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u75c7443f" id="u75c7443f">（直接不更新）</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u5926079c" id="u5926079c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u818fd9bd" id="u818fd9bd" style="color: #70000D">2）SAPO：用连续软核替代硬指示函数， 从而避免 GRPO 的 band 外直接 0 的硬截断效应，带来更稳定的更新动态  </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uca2fcfc5" id="uca2fcfc5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3dcee2df5e99509e09dda8148220cdcd.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YbObd%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7dd939ff"><li fid="ud13f432b" data-lake-id="ud03d09ae" id="ud03d09ae"><span data-lake-id="u196b3839" id="u196b3839">policy change 小时：梯度保持敏感，允许更充分的参数更新</span></li><li fid="ud13f432b" data-lake-id="uf66ae285" id="uf66ae285"><span data-lake-id="u7701b2e3" id="u7701b2e3">偏离增大时：梯度</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf42154b3" id="uf42154b3">平滑缩小</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2b140920" id="u2b140920">，更新自动变保守；对比之下，GRPO 的硬 token clipping 是 all-or-nothing，容易造成脆、易不稳的优化行为</span></li></ul>